{"id": "556", "question": "How many people are in the image?", "gt": "Two are visible.; There are two people.; Just two people are visible in the image.", "pred": "There are 4-5 people in the image.", "group_key": "visual challenge", "sub_category": "visual challenge", "dataset": "haloquest", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "To determine how many people are in the image, I'll analyze the visual content step by step:\n\n1. The main subject of the image is a woman who is talking on her phone. She is clearly visible and counts as one person.\n\n2. In the background, there is a group of people under a tent. While they are partially obscured, I can discern at least three distinct individuals in this group.\n\n3. There are no other visible people in the image besides the woman and the group under the tent.\n\nAdding these up:\n- 1 person (the woman in the foreground)\n- 3 people (in the group under the tent)\n\nFinal answer: There are 4 people in the image.", "cot": "[\"To determine how many people are in the image, I'll analyze the visual content step by step:\\n\\n1. The main subject of the image is a woman who is talking on her phone. She is clearly visible and counts as one person.\\n\\n2. In the background, there is a group of people under a tent. While they are partially obscured, I can discern at least three distinct individuals in this group.\\n\\n3. There are no other visible people in the image besides the woman and the group under the tent.\\n\\nAdding these up:\\n- 1 person (the woman in the foreground)\\n- 3 people (in the group under the tent)\\n\\nFinal answer: There are 4 people in the image.\", \"To determine the number of people in the image, I'll analyze the visual content step by step:\\n\\n1. The main focus is on a woman in the foreground who is talking on a phone.\\n2. In the background, there appears to be a group of people under a tent on the left side of the image.\\n3. The group under the tent seems to consist of at least 3-4 individuals, but 